frpc-rust

This project implements a native Rust client interoperating with the frp v1
protocol. It is not an official release of the frp project.

Protocol layouts and compatibility behavior were referenced from:
- frp, https://github.com/fatedier/frp
  v0.70.0, commit 7b6e01f04f286632f0d23715aa17a3bc41234b5c
  Copyright 2016-present fatedier and The frp Authors, Apache License 2.0.
- golib, https://github.com/fatedier/golib
  v0.7.0, commit c3ed68fa2f49b5820d3c07b3cfc59d0f0ad46468
  Copyright fatedier and contributors, Apache License 2.0.

The v1 authentication digest, PBKDF2/AES-CFB stream parameters, Snappy framing,
message field names and transport handshakes intentionally follow those projects.
Rust dependencies retain their respective licenses; see Cargo.lock and each
dependency's distributed license for details.
